{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 99 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "f991fe531b20a157fd3083765f9d7c7051b61ec2230530176a8a4c2cf1c0ca78" :edb/db-before-t 98 :edb/db-after-t 99 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533411 50 #inst "2026-10-10T07:45:18.384Z" 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186054852 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297339 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186059681 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297322 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186059683 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297165 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186059685 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297327 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186059812 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297550 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186059812 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297551 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186059812 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297554 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186060267 1068 #edb/ref 17592186058194 13194139533411 17592186045585 false] [17592186060267 1068 #edb/ref 17592186297008 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186060267 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186060267 1071 "Given $h(x) = 3x^{2} - 5x + \\frac{3}{x}$, find $h^{‴}(x)$." 13194139533411 17592186045585 false] [17592186060267 1071 "Given $h(x)=3{x}^{2}-5x+\\frac{3}{x},$ find ${h}^{‴}(x).$" 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186060267 1074 "First, notice that we can rewrite the function as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}h(x) & =3{x}^{2}-5x+\\frac{3}{x} \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}-5x+3{x}^{-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{x}^{2}-5x+3{x}^{-1}) \\\\  & =6x-5-3{x}^{-2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6x-5-3{x}^{-2}) \\\\  & =6+6{x}^{-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6+6{x}^{-3}) \\\\  & =-18{x}^{-4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{18}{{x}^{4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064170 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297411 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064178 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297347 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064183 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297348 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064183 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297350 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064183 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297353 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064183 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297364 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064202 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297251 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064202 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297441 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064203 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297252 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064203 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297442 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064204 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297245 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064204 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297246 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064213 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297292 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064257 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297355 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064258 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297356 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064258 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297357 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064258 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297358 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064259 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297359 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064259 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297360 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064260 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297361 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064260 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297362 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064260 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297363 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064287 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297328 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186064287 1038 #edb/ref 17592186297