 $T$ is equal to $|det(T)|.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|det(T)| & =|-6\\cdot (-5)-1\\cdot (-4)| \\\\  & =|30-(-4)| \\\\  & =34.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297505 1068 #edb/ref 17592186296870 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297505 1069 "q-316575" 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297505 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297505 1071 "What is the area scale factor of the linear transformation $T$ that is given by its standard matrix \n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}9 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\nThe area scale factor is\n{{field-1}} ." 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297505 1072 #uuid "96128bf4-884b-533c-a22d-9c6cd62a740d" 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297505 1074 "The area scale factor of a linear transformation $T$ with standard matrix $T$ is equal to $|det(T)|.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|det(T)| & =|9\\cdot 1-(-4)\\cdot 2| \\\\  & =|9-(-8)| \\\\  & =17.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297506 1068 #edb/ref 17592186296806 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297506 1069 "q-316578" 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297506 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297506 1071 "What is the area scale factor of the linear transformation $T$ that is given by its standard matrix \n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\nThe area scale factor is\n{{field-1}} ." 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297506 1072 #uuid "a6f58c85-198e-5060-8c53-9bc302a186d0" 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297506 1074 "The area scale factor of a linear transformation $T$ with standard matrix $T$ is equal to $|det(T)|.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|det(T)| & =|8\\cdot 2-7\\cdot (-3)| \\\\  & =|16-(-21)| \\\\  & =37.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533411 17592186045585 true] [17592186297507 1068 #edb/ref 17592186297080 13